        "title": "Our registered address",
        "description": "For legal correspondence only - please do not visit.",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Engines Market 123 Business Name, Street, City, Postcode"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Important: This address is for legal correspondence only. Please do not visit - we cannot accept visitors or customer vehicles at this address. If you need to send a letter (e.g., formal complaint or legal document), please use the email addresses above first. Postal correspondence will be handled but may take longer to receive and respond to."
